            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"0\":{\"offeringId\":\"6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05\",\"extraction\":{\"name\":\"OLIPOP Classic Grape (9g Fiber)\",\"kind\":\"physical\",\"summary\":\"A nostalgic grape soda made with real concord grape juice and a hint of lime, featuring 9g of prebiotic fiber to support digestive health.\",\"productTruth\":{\"brand\":\"OLIPOP\",\"fiber\":\"9g\",\"flavor\":\"Classic Grape\",\"images\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044959-75d02dc6-ee4a-4327-9a07-2a07af4ac4f7.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044988-c90d0c25-e013-4033-b7c5-c3edffdaa39e.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044871-a5a86616-92ae-4852-bad3-177faba13db5.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044884-4c2f0ce1-057a-4724-915f-95d54302022d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044976-bb2130ff-2b33-41e7-b49f-b09615e45f61.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953045062-bbfc62a4-c529-4fd2-b8ad-f2c0fe483477.jpg\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953045003-56a3e828-5361-4af0-8f80-68bc471a5168.png\"],\"sugars\":\"5g\",\"calories\":50,\"fiberLine\":\"9g Fiber Line\",\"description\":\"Sweet-tart concord grape juice, kissed with lime. Our original refrigerated formula, with higher fiber per can to get more out of every sip.\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"ingredients\":[\"Carbonated Water\",\"OLISMART (Cassava Root Fiber, Chicory Root Inulin, Jerusalem Artichoke Inulin, Nopal Cactus, Marshmallow Root, Calendula Flower, Kudzu Root)\",\"Concord Grape Juice Concentrate\",\"Cassava Root Syrup\",\"Apple Juice Concentrate\",\"Tartaric Acid (From Grapes)\",\"Quince Juice Concentra