\\\" in small, dark-green block capitals. A variant design is also shown in some contexts, featuring a deep violet-purple can body with white lettering, white highlights on the grapes, and a lowercase \\\"classic grape\\\" flavor label.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044959-75d02dc6-ee4a-4327-9a07-2a07af4ac4f7.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044988-c90d0c25-e013-4033-b7c5-c3edffdaa39e.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044871-a5a86616-92ae-4852-bad3-177faba13db5.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044884-4c2f0ce1-057a-4724-915f-95d54302022d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/55336a61-ed44-47da-8a4b-bb3de1ed770c/d71a39c0-4d73-4ec1-92f7-fb7d40ab5358.png\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044959-75d02dc6-ee4a-4327-9a07-2a07af4ac4f7.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044988-c90d0c25-e013-4033-b7c5-c3edffdaa39e.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044871-a5a86616-92ae-4852-bad3-177faba13db5.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044884-4c2f0ce1-057a-4724-915f-95d54302022d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/55336a61-ed44-47da-8a4b-bb3de1ed770c/d71a39c0-4d73-4ec1-92f7-fb7d40ab5358.png\"]},\"performanceLabels\":{},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T07:52:08.366Z\",\"versions\":[{\"id\":\"e39f4df0-0eaf-4f06-b6a7-bd480f671cf6\",\"creativeId\":\"a1da774f-022a-4500-878a-6c92ab359154\",\"versionNumber\":1,\"parentVersionId\":null,\"generationJobId\":\"e6197abb-f31d-4604