ded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/55336a61-ed44-47da-8a4b-bb3de1ed770c/d71a39c0-4d73-4ec1-92f7-fb7d40ab5358.png\",\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044959-75d02dc6-ee4a-4327-9a07-2a07af4ac4f7.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044988-c90d0c25-e013-4033-b7c5-c3edffdaa39e.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044871-a5a86616-92ae-4852-bad3-177faba13db5.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044884-4c2f0ce1-057a-4724-915f-95d54302022d.webp\"],\"visualDescription\":\"This standard 12 fl oz (355 mL) aluminum soda can features a matte, desaturated pale lavender-purple background with a metallic silver top, rim, and pull-tab. The front face is dominated by the brand name \\\"OLIPOP\\\" printed in large, arched, bold, deep-purple capital letters. Directly below this is a stylized graphic of a grape bunch composed of overlapping deep-purple circles, each with a small white crescent highlight, topped by a single dark-green leaf and stem. To the left of the grapes, the words \\\"P