 half is a solid charcoal-grey block featuring a minimalist, high-contrast graphic of a jagged red lightning bolt symbolizing an energy crash. The right half is a clean off-white block separated by a thick, sweeping, organic Hunter Green wave, highlighting a crisp, front-facing studio shot of the lavender-purple OLIPOP Classic Grape can. The visual hero is the can itself, showing the clean, gut-friendly solution. Overlaid across the top is the headline \\\"Love grape soda? Skip the crash.\\\" written in bold WindsorEF. A small circular green starburst badge reads \\\"9g Prebiotic Fiber\\\" and \\\"5g Sugar\\\". The soft CTA is a pill-shaped Hunter Green button that reads \\\"Learn more\\\" in bold Ano. Keep this on-brand by using Olipop's signature Hunter Green and Electric Citron colors, balancing playful retro typography with geometric layouts, and keeping the visual clean and clutter-free.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This standard 12 fl oz (355 mL) aluminum soda can features a matte, desaturated pale lavender-purple background with a metallic silver top, rim, and pull-tab. The front face is dominated by the brand name \\\"OLIPOP\\\" printed in large, arched, bold, deep-purple capital letters. Directly below this is a stylized graphic of a grape bunch composed of overlapping deep-purple circles, each with a small white crescent highlight, topped by a single dark-green leaf and stem. To the left of the grapes, the words \\\"Prebiotics,\\\" \\\"Botanicals,\\\" and \\\"Plant Fiber\\\" are stacked vertically in a small, dark-green, sans-serif font, while to the right sits a circular dark-green \\\"Plant Powered / Microbiome Approved\\\" seal. Below the grape graphic, the flavor \\\"Classic Grape\\\" is written in a prominent, stacked, dark-green serif font, followed by the tagline \\\"A New Kind of Soda™\\\" in medium-purple sans-serif, with the volume \\\"12 fl oz (355 mL)\\\" centered at the very bottom. The lower-left flank displays \\\"Non GMO\\\" and the lower-right