358.png\"],\"normalizedReferenceImageUrls\":[],\"usedNormalizedReferenceImages\":false},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-17T07:52:08.366Z\",\"variations\":[{\"id\":\"5fdc9e91-ab28-4038-9d0e-a584899e50ce\",\"creativeVersionId\":\"6ba80299-eb2a-4a76-a5a0-d6398eacfdf8\",\"variationType\":\"size\",\"variationKey\":\"original\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"aspectRatio\":null,\"platform\":null,\"isPrimary\":true,\"storageKey\":\"campaign-creatives/28f91be7-914f-49e6-8d2f-1f5c9551d710/5c94feb6-d14a-4a08-893b-d12350366cb7.png\",\"assetUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/28f91be7-914f-49e6-8d2f-1f5c9551d710/5c94feb6-d14a-4a08-893b-d12350366cb7.png\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/campaign-creatives/28f91be7-914f-49e6-8d2f-1f5c9551d710/5c94feb6-d14a-4a08-893b-d12350366cb7.png\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"downloadCount\":0,\"status\":\"generated\",\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the Attention-Interest-Desire-Action (AIDA) framework for the Routine-Replenishment archetype, this static 1:1 ad establishes a healthy daily ritual. The visual is a native-feeling, in-context lifestyle photograph capturing a bright, realistic perspective of an open, beautifully organized home refrigerator shelf. The shelf is neatly stocked with matte lavender-purple OLIPOP Classic Grape cans, and a hand in a cozy, cream-colored knit sleeve is shown reaching in to grab one. The scene is illuminated by warm, inviting, bright light that makes the silver pull-tabs shimmer. The visual hero is the daily routine itself. Centered at the top in elegant, bold WindsorEF is the headline \\\"Meet your new daily 3PM ritual.\\\" At the bottom, a small, subtle off-white circular badge mentions \\\"Only 5g of sugar.\\\" The soft CTA is a pill-shaped Citron Yellow button reading \\\"Explore the collection\\\" in clean Ano. Keep this on-brand by focusing on bright, naturalistic photography with a nostalgic yet modern feel, avoiding artificial studio shadows, and utilizing the primary Hunter Green and Citron Yellow color palette.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Attention-Interest-Desire-Action (AIDA) framework for the Routine-Replenishment archetype, this static 1:1 ad establishes a healthy daily ritual. The visual is a native-feeling, in-context lifestyle photograph capturing a bright, realistic perspective of an open, beautifully organized home refrigerator shelf. The shelf is neatly stocked with matte lavender-purple OLIPOP Classic Grape cans, and a hand in a cozy, cream-colored knit sleeve is shown reaching in to grab one. The scene is illuminated by warm, inviting, bright light that makes the silver pull-tabs shimmer. The visual hero is the daily routine itself. Centered at the top in elegant, bold WindsorEF is the headline \\\"Meet your new daily 3PM ritual.\\\" At the bottom, a small, subtle off-white circular badge mentions \\\"Only 5g of sugar.\\\" The soft CTA is a pill-shaped Citron Yellow button reading \\\"Explore the collection\\\" in clean Ano. Keep this on-brand by focusing on bright, naturalistic photography with a nostalgic yet modern feel, avoiding artificial studio shadows, and utilizing the primary Hunter Green and Citron Yellow color palette.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This standard 12 fl oz (355 mL) aluminum soda can features a matte, desaturated pale lavender-purple background with a metallic silver top, rim, and pull-tab. The front face is dominated by the brand name \\\"OLIPOP\\\" printed in large, arched, bold, deep-purple capital letters. Directly below this is a stylized graphic of a grape bunch composed of overlapping deep-purple circles, each with a small white crescent highlight, topped by a single dark-green leaf and stem. To the left of the grapes, the words \\\"Prebiotics,\\\" \\\"Botanicals,\\\" and \\\"Plant Fiber\\\" are stacked vertically in a small, dark-green, sans-serif font, while to the right sits a circular dark-green \\\"Plant Powered / Microbiome Approved\\\" seal. Below the grape graphic, the flavor \\\"Classic Grape\\\" is written in a prominent, stacked, dark-green serif font, followed by the tagline \\\"A New Kind of Soda™\\\" in medium-purple sans-serif, with the volume \\\"12 fl oz (355 mL)\\\" centered at the very bottom. The lower-left flank displays \\\"Non GMO\\\" and the lower-right displays \\\"5g of sugar per can\\\" in matching medium-purple text, while the upper shoulder of the can reads \\\"Supports Digestive Health\\\" in small, dark-green block capitals. A variant design is also shown in some contexts, featuring a deep violet-purple can body with white lettering, white highlights on the grapes, and a lowercase \\\"classic grape\\\" flavor label.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"source\":\"campaign-creatives\",\"language\":\"English\",\"lastError\":null,\"imageModel\":\"openai/gpt-image-2:100\",\"hasNSFWRisk\":false,\"imagePrompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Attention-Interest-Desire-Action (AIDA) framework for the Routine-Replenishment archetype, this static 1:1 ad establishes a healthy daily ritual. The visual is a native-feeling, in-context lifestyle photograph capturing a bright, realistic perspective of an open, beautifully organized home refrigerator shelf. The shelf is neatly stocked with matte lavender-purple OLIPOP Classic Grape cans, and a hand in a cozy, cream-colored knit sleeve is shown reaching in to grab one. The scene is illuminated by warm, inviting, bright light that makes the silver pull-tabs shimmer. The visual hero is the daily routine itself. Centered at the top in elegant, bold WindsorEF is the headline \\\"Meet your new daily 3PM ritual.\\\" At the bottom, a small, subtle off-white circular badge mentions \\\"Only 5g of sugar.\\\" The soft CTA is a pill-shaped Citron Yellow button reading \\\"Explore the collection\\\" in clean Ano. Keep this on-brand by focusing on bright, naturalistic photography with a nostalgic yet modern feel, avoiding artificial studio shadows, and utilizing the primary Hunter Green and Citron Yellow color palette.\\n\\nProduct appearance: This standard 12 fl oz (355 mL) aluminum soda can features a matte, desaturated pale lavender-purple background with a metallic silver top, rim, and pull-tab. The front face is dominated by the brand name \\\"OLIPOP\\\" printed in large, arched, bold, deep-purple capital letters. Directly below this is a stylized graphic of a grape bunch composed of overlapping deep-purple circles, each with a small white crescent highlight, topped by a single dark-green leaf and stem. To the left of the grapes, the words \\\"Prebiotics,\\\" \\\"Botanicals,\\\" and \\\"Plant Fiber\\\" are stacked vertically in a small, dark-green, sans-serif font, while to the right sits a circular dark-green \\\"Plant Powered / Microbiome Approved\\\" seal. Below the grape graphic, the flavor \\\"Classic Grape\\\" is written in a prominent, stacked, dark-green serif font, followed by the tagline \\\"A New Kind of Soda™\\\" in medium-purple sans-serif, with the volume \\\"12 fl oz (355 mL)\\\" centered at the very bottom. The lower-left flank displays \\\"Non GMO\\\" and the lower-right displays \\\"5g of sugar per can\\\" in matching medium-purple text, while the upper shoulder of the can reads \\\"Supports Digestive Health\\\" in small, dark-green block capitals. A variant design is also shown in some contexts, featuring a deep violet-purple can body with white lettering, white highlights on the grapes, and a lowercase \\\"classic grape\\\" flavor label.\\n\\nUse the product appearance text only as a private visual reference for accurately drawing the product. Do not print, quote, paraphrase, label, or turn any of that description into ad copy. Treat orientation-specific details carefully: show front-only details only when the product front is visible; if the brief shows the back, side, top, or an angled view where those details would not be visible, omit them instead of moving them onto the wrong face.\\n\\nThe attached product photos show the real product — reproduce it faithfully.\\n\\nThe final attached image is the official brand logo. Add it once, subtly, in clean negative space; keep it exact, legible, and uncropped.\\n\\nDesign requirements (apply to this ad):\\n- Follow the instructions by the director.\\n- Make the ad design, layout, typography on-branded, but should look premium, editorial-like.\\n- Establish a clear visual hierarchy: one dominant focal point the eye lands on\\n  first, then the supporting message, then the CTA.\\n- Keep strong figure/ground contrast. If text sits over imagery, place a scrim or\\n  overlay behind it so it stays fully legible.\\n- Place the focal subject on a rule-of-thirds line; leave generous whitespace and\\n  avoid clutter.\\n- Use a limited palette anchored to the brand colors (~60-30-10), reserving one\\n  accent color for the call to action.\\n- Keep 20% space all around the creative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"brandLogoUrl\":\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/55336a61-ed44-47da-8a4b-bb3de1ed770c/d71a39c0-4d73-4ec1-92f7-fb7d40ab5358.png\",\"imageProvider\":\"openai\",\"productImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044959-75d02dc6-ee4a-4327-9a07-2a07af4ac4f7.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044988-c90d0c25-e013-4033-b7c5-c3edffdaa39e.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044871-a5a86616-92ae-4852-bad3-177faba13db5.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044884-4c2f0ce1-057a-4724-915f-95d54302022d.webp\"],\"visualDescription\":\"This standard 12 fl oz (355 mL) aluminum soda can features a matte, desaturated pale lavender-purple background with a metallic silver top, rim, and pull-tab. The front face is dominated by the brand name \\\"OLIPOP\\\" printed in large, arched, bold, deep-purple capital letters. Directly below this is a stylized graphic of a grape bunch composed of overlapping deep-purple circles, each with a small white crescent highlight, topped by a single dark-green leaf and stem. To the left of the grapes, the words \\\"Prebiotics,\\\" \\\"Botanicals,\\\" and \\\"Plant Fiber\\\" are stacked vertically in a small, dark-green, sans-serif font, while to the right sits a circular dark-green \\\"Plant Powered / Microbiome Approved\\\" seal. Below the grape graphic, the flavor \\\"Classic Grape\\\" is written in a prominent, stacked, dark-green serif font, followed by the tagline \\\"A New Kind of Soda™\\\" in medium-purple sans-serif, with the volume \\\"12 fl oz (355 mL)\\\" centered at the very bottom. The lower-left flank displays \\\"Non GMO\\\" and the lower-right displays \\\"5g of sugar per can\\\" in matching medium-purple text, while the upper shoulder of the can reads \\\"Supports Digestive Health\\\" in small, dark-green block capitals. A variant design is also shown in some contexts, featuring a deep violet-purple can body with white lettering, white highlights on the grapes, and a lowercase \\\"classic grape\\\" flavor label.\",\"referenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044959-75d02dc6-ee4a-4327-9a07-2a07af4ac4f7.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044988-c90d0c25-e013-4033-b7c5-c3edffdaa39e.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044871-a5a86616-92ae-4852-bad3-177faba13db5.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044884-4c2f0ce1-057a-4724-915f-95d54302022d.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/brand-logos/55336a61-ed44-47da-8a4b-bb3de1ed770c/d71a39c0-4d73-4ec1-92f7-fb7d40ab5358.png\"],\"referenceAdImageUrls\":[],\"originalReferenceImageUrls\":[\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044959-75d02dc6-ee4a-4327-9a07-2a07af4ac4f7.webp\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044988-c90d0c25-e013-4033-b7c5-c3edffdaa39e.png\",\"https://localads.t3.storage.dev/product-images/6442dc69-08c3-4b2d-ba24-2d75074cfe05/1786953044871-a5a86616-92ae-4852-bad3-177faba13db5.webp\",\"https://local