eative for the ad to look cleaner\\n- Group and align elements cleanly (Gestalt); use at most two type styles.\",\"status\":\"generated\",\"createdBy\":\"f5dfb377-dac7-46a6-aea3-a4e04cb45e54\",\"metadata\":{\"brief\":\"Using the Attention-Interest-Desire-Action (AIDA) framework for the Routine-Replenishment archetype, this static 1:1 ad establishes a healthy daily ritual. The visual is a native-feeling, in-context lifestyle photograph capturing a bright, realistic perspective of an open, beautifully organized home refrigerator shelf. The shelf is neatly stocked with matte lavender-purple OLIPOP Classic Grape cans, and a hand in a cozy, cream-colored knit sleeve is shown reaching in to grab one. The scene is illuminated by warm, inviting, bright light that makes the silver pull-tabs shimmer. The visual hero is the daily routine itself. Centered at the top in elegant, bold WindsorEF is the headline \\\"Meet your new daily 3PM ritual.\\\" At the bottom, a small, subtle off-white circular badge mentions \\\"Only 5g of sugar.\\\" The soft CTA is a pill-shaped Citron Yellow button reading \\\"Explore the collection\\\" in clean Ano. Keep this on-brand by focusing on bright, naturalistic photography with a nostalgic yet modern feel, avoiding artificial studio shadows, and utilizing the primary Hunter Green and Citron Yellow color palette.\",\"prompt\":\"Instructions by the director: Using the Attention-Interest-Desire-Action (AIDA) framework for the Routine-Replenishment archetype, this static 1:1 ad establishes a healthy daily ritual. The visual is a native-feeling, in-context lifestyle photograph capturing a bright, realistic perspective of an open, beautifully organized home refrigerator shelf. The shelf is neatly stocked with matte lavender-purple OLIPOP Classic Grape cans, and a hand in a cozy, cream-colored knit sleeve is shown reaching in to grab one. The scene is illuminated by warm, inviting, bright light that makes the silver pull-tabs shimmer. The visual hero is